tpm 1
boot power
# title-early: power-on with blank cards; SW_ON and TIT_DEMO's whole story without input. Start at
# TITLE's tick 2 (the first tick a movie can press) reaches the run step before phase 0 has
# requested the title music: the skip to "press start" leaves the music unrequested (no bgm 0x22
# at all). Start at tick 200 exits to SELECT (5 ticks).
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
2 1 START
200 1 START
program SELECT
end 5
